ViridianForest_Text_FriendsItchingToBattle::
    .string "I came here with some friends to\n"
    .string "catch us some BUG POKéMON!\p"
    .string "They're all itching to get into\n"
    .string "some POKéMON battles!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RickIntro::
    .string "Hey! You have POKéMON!\n"
    .string "Come on!\l"
    .string "Let's battle 'em!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RickDefeat::
    .string "No!\n"
    .string "CATERPIE got tangled up in the\n"
    .string "forest pace!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RickPostBattle::
    .string "Ssh! You'll scare the bugs away.\n"
    .string "Another time, okay?$"

ViridianForest_Text_DougIntro::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "You can't jam out if you're a\l"
    .string "POKéMON TRAINER!$"

ViridianForest_Text_DougDefeat::
    .string "Huh?\n"
    .string "I ran out of POKéMON!$"

ViridianForest_Text_DougPostBattle::
    .string "That totally stinks! I'm going to\n"
    .string "catch some stronger ones!$"

ViridianForest_Text_SammyIntro::
    .string "Hey, wait up!\n"
    .string "What's the hurry? Why the rush?$"

ViridianForest_Text_SammyDefeat::
    .string "I give!\n"
    .string "You're good at this!$"

ViridianForest_Text_SammyPostBattle::
    .string "Sometimes, you can find stuff on\n"
    .string "the ground.\p"
    .string "I'm looking for the stuff I\n"
    .string "dropped. Can you help me?$"

ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyIntro::
    .string "I might be little, but I won't like\n"
    .string "it if you go easy on me!$"

ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyDefeat::
    .string "Oh, boo.\n"
    .string "Nothing went right.$"

ViridianForest_Text_AnthonyPostBattle::
    .string "I lost some of my allowance…$"

ViridianForest_Text_CharlieIntro::
    .string "Did you know that POKéMON evolve?$"

ViridianForest_Text_CharlieDefeat::
    .string "Oh!\n"
    .string "Guess evolving fast isn't the same\n"
    .string "as battling well.$"

ViridianForest_Text_CharliePostBattle::
    .string "BUG POKéMON evolve quickly.\n"
    .string "They're a lot of fun!$"

ViridianForest_Text_RanOutOfPokeBalls::
    .string "I was throwing POKé BALLS to\n"
    .string "catch POKéMON, and I ran out.\p"
    .string "That's why you can never have too\n"
    .string "many POKé BALLS.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ErikaLookingForRoot::
    .string "ERIKA: Oh, hello.\p"
    .string "I came to VIRIDIAN FOREST in\n"
    .string "search of an ENERGY ROOT.\p"
    .string "Roots are quiet things, yet they\n"
    .string "bind a whole garden together.\p"
    .string "A root grown here is said to heal\n"
    .string "because the forest shares its\l"
    .string "strength as one family.\p"
    .string "I am certain one can be found\n"
    .string "somewhere nearby.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ErikaShownRoot::
    .string "ERIKA: Oh!\n"
    .string "That ENERGY ROOT is splendid.\p"
    .string "See how many tiny roots gather\n"
    .string "into one strong whole?\p"
    .string "It reminds me that families,\n"
    .string "friends, and communities grow\l"
    .string "best together.\p"
    .string "If I could find one of my own, I\n"
    .string "would gladly return to the GYM.$"

ViridianForest_Text_GymGuideFoundErika::
    .string "ERIKA!\n"
    .string "I am so glad I found you!\p"
    .string "And look, I found an ENERGY ROOT\n"
    .string "on the way here.\p"
    .string "It was tucked among other roots,\n"
    .string "all holding the soil together.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ErikaChallenge::
    .string "ERIKA: How fortunate.\n"
    .string "That is just the lesson I hoped\l"
    .string "this forest would offer.\p"
    .string "Some POKéMON bloom only when\n"
    .string "friendship has taken root.\p"
    .string "That kind of evolution is a bond,\n"
    .string "not merely a change in form.\p"
    .string "Before I return, may I ask you for\n"
    .string "a proper GYM challenge?\p"
    .string "With my GYM GUIDE present, the\n"
    .string "match will be official.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ErikaBattleIntro::
    .string "Very well.\p"
    .string "Show me how friendship has helped\n"
    .string "your POKéMON grow.\p"
    .string "Let us begin.{PLAY_BGM MUS_ENCOUNTER_GYM_LEADER}$"

ViridianForest_Text_ErikaDefeat::
    .string "Oh!\n"
    .string "I concede defeat.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ErikaAfterBattle::
    .string "ERIKA: You are remarkably strong.\p"
    .string "This battle was witnessed, so it\n"
    .string "shall stand as your GYM challenge.\p"
    .string "I must confer on you the\n"
    .string "RAINBOWBADGE.\n"
    .string "{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}\p"
    .string "I saw trust in the way your\n"
    .string "POKéMON stood with you.\p"
    .string "Friendship can guide evolution\n"
    .string "as surely as sunlight guides\l"
    .string "a bud into bloom.\p"
    .string "Please come to CELADON GYM.\n"
    .string "There, I will give a reward for\l"
    .string "the growth you have shown.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ReceivedRainbowKeyFromErika::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the RAINBOW KEY\n"
    .string "from ERIKA.$"

ViridianForest_Text_ExplainRainbowKey::
    .string "The RAINBOW KEY opens the\n"
    .string "BERRY PATCH next door to\l"
    .string "CELADON GYM.\p"
    .string "Please feel free to pick the\n"
    .string "berries growing there.$"

ViridianForest_Text_LeavingViridianForest::
    .string "LEAVING VIRIDIAN FOREST\n"
    .string "PEWTER CITY AHEAD$"

ViridianForest_Text_TangrowthVanished::
    .string "TANGROWTH vanished into the\n"
    .string "flowers!$"
